                <pb facs="0071" n="51" sameAs="frus:frus1961-63v02/pg51"/>

                <head>28. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On January 18, 1962, Chairman of the Joint Chiefs of Staff General Lemnitzer,
                    transmitted to Secretary McNamara, CM-491-62, a four-paragraph memorandum on the
                    Vietnamese command problem. For text of this memorandum, see <hi
                        rendition="#italic">United States-Vietnam Relations, 1945-1967</hi>, Book
                    12, pages 440-441.</p>
            </div>
